000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.     TRPTHU.
000400 AUTHOR.         N W REGIMBAL.
000500*INSTALLATION.   GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER COMPANY.
000600*DATE-WRITTEN.   DEC 05, 1980.
000700*REMARKS.        THIS PROGRAM PRINTS A REPORT SHOWING ALL
000800*                CORP-CODES AND ITEM STATUS PER CODE.
000900*
001000*                JULY 1, 1982, THE BUFFER AREA MSTORERM WAS
001100*                CHANGED IN PREPARATION FOR THE NEW DATA
001200*                BASE CHANGES. B.J.P.
001300*
001400*                JUNE 16,1983, ADDED DISBURSEMENT INSTRUCTIONS
001500*                TO PRINT LINE AND FIRST LINE OF DESCRIPTION.
001600*                ATL.
001700*
001800*                ADDED INTERNATIONAL DATE ROUTINE "TDATECHK" ON
001900*                MAY 21, 1985.    V.W.D.
002000*
002100*       ON AUGUST 16, 1985 ADDED A SORT OPTION TO THE PROGRAM.
002200*       THE PROGRAM MAY NOW SORT BY CORP-CODE OR HIGH-USAGE
002300*       AREA.  HIGH-USAGE IS NOW DETERMINED BY STR-HIGH-USAGE
002400*       INSTEAD OF DISB-INSTR||  IF THE REPORT IS SORTED BY
002500*       CODE A GRAND-TOTAL IS GIVEN AND IF THE REPORT IS SORTED
002600*       BY HIGH-USAGE AREA A TOTAL IS GIVEN FOR EACH AREA.
002700*
002800*                FEB 05, 1986
002900*                1. CALLS TESCSEQ FOR EXTERNALLY SUPPLIED
003000*                   ESCAPE SEQUENCES.
003100*                2. COPIES ESC-NAME FROM COPYLIB.DB.
003200*                3. MOVES ADDED TO INSERT PROPER ESCAPE
003300*                   SEQUENCES FOR PRINTING.
003400*                       C.R.K.
003500*
003600*      SEPTEMBER 8, 1986                   BARBARA WINTER.
003700*        1.  MODIFY REPORT TO SHOW COMPLETE DESCRIPTION
003800*            INSTEAD OF FIRST LINE ONLY.
003900*        2.  MODIFY REPORT TO SHOW BIN LOCATIONS.
004000*        3.  ALLOW USER TO SPECIFY UP TO THREE DIFFERENT
004100*            BIN LOCATIONS OR ENTER ALL LOCATIONS.
004200*
004300*      DECEMBER 1, 1986
004400*        EXPANDED THE SIZE OF ALL PRICE/COST FIELDS.  ALSO ADDED
004500*        COPYLIB AS NEEDED.        D.A. PLUM.
004600*
004700*      JANUARY 20, 1987
004800*        REPLACED CALLS TO DBEXPLAIN WITH TBLOWUP.
004900*        USER CAN NOW CHOOSE THE NUMBER OF REPTS DESIRED.
005000*                                   A. M. KRAUSS.
005100*
      *C  JUNE 23, 1994   CR KALMAN
      *C   ADDED CALL TO COBOL ERROR HANDLER -MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C  SEPT 04, 1996   CA YODER
      *C   MODIFIED PROGRAM FOR CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C
      *C  08/05/1997   CA YODER     REQ #95-015
      *C    MODIFIED PROGRAM TO ACCEPT AND USE THE NEW OPTIONS ADDED
      *C    TO THE MATERIALS CONTROL REPORTS.
      *C    NOTE:  THIS PROGRAM NOW USES COPYLIB MEMBERS FOR MOST OF
      *C           ITS PROCESSING LOGIC.  TO SEE ALL OF THE MEMBERS,
      *C           LOOK IN COPYLIB FOR THE FILES THAT START WITH THE
      *C           PREFIX "MTLS".
      *C
